              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.20.20+LUK.20.21+LUK.20.22+LUK.20.23+LUK.20.24+LUK.20.25+LUK.20.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 20:20-26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.22.15+MAT.22.16+MAT.22.17+MAT.22.18+MAT.22.19+MAT.22.20+MAT.22.21+MAT.22.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 22:15-22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi bakamutumaho abamwe aha Bafarisaayo n'aba Heroode kumutega omu bigambo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baija baamugira bati: Mwegyesa, nitumanya ku ori ow'amazima, kandi togwera rubaju rw'omuntu weeena orutahikire, ahabw'okuba totiinisibwa kitiinisa ky'omuntu, kureka oyegyesa omuhanda gwa Ruhanga omu mazima. Ebiragiro nibiikiriza kuha Kaisaari omushoro, nari tikwo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tushore, nari turereere? Kwonka ku yaamanyire oburyarya bwabo, yaabagira ati: Nimuntegyera ki? Mundeetere edenaari, ngireebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baagireeta. Yaababuuza ati: Ekishishani eki n'ebihandiikirweho n'eby'oha? Baamugarukamu bati: N'ebya Kaisaari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ROM.13.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Rom 13:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yesu yaabagira ati: Mbwenu nu ebya Kaisaari mubihe Kaisaari; n'ebya Ruhanga mubihe Ruhanga. Baamutangaarira munonga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
