              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.20.27+LUK.20.28+LUK.20.29+LUK.20.30+LUK.20.31+LUK.20.32+LUK.20.33+LUK.20.34+LUK.20.35+LUK.20.36+LUK.20.37+LUK.20.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luk 20:27-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.22.23+MAT.22.24+MAT.22.25+MAT.22.26+MAT.22.27+MAT.22.28+MAT.22.29+MAT.22.30+MAT.22.31+MAT.22.32+MAT.22.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mat 22:23-33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Abasadukaayo, abahakana ku hatariho kuzooka, baija ah'ari, baamubuuza bati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.25.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 25:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.25.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mwegyesa, Musa akatuhandiikira, yaatugira ati: Mwene ishe w'omuntu, ku arifa yaatsiga omukazi atakazaire nwe, omuntu ogwo ahungure ogwo mufaakazi, amumuzaarireho abaana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu hakaba hariho enyine-emwe mushanju; mukuru waabo akashwera omukazi; yaafa atakazaire nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omurumuna yaamuhungura, nawe yaafa atakazaire; n'owa kashatu atyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Boona omushanju baafa batakazaire nawe. Bwanyima omukazi ogwo nawe yaabakurata, yaafa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu omu kuzooka aryaba muka oha? Ahakuba boona omushanju bakamushwera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu yaabagarukamu ati: Ekibahabisa t'okutamanya Byahandiikirwe, n'obu gaakuba amaani ga Ruhanga? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahakuba omu kuzooka tibarishwera, kandi tibarishwerwa, kureka baryaba nka baamaraika ab'omu iguru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.3.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 3:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.3.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ebirikukwata aha by'okuzooka kw'abafu, timukashomaga omu kitabo kya Musa, Ruhanga oku yaamugambiire ari aha Rushaka, ati: Nyowe ndi Ruhanga wa Abrahamu, Ruhanga wa Isaaka, kandi Ruhanga wa Yakobo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ruhanga ti Ruhanga w'abafu, kureka ow'abahuriire. Muhabire munonga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.12.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
