        {
          "text": " Kandi omwe aha bahandiiki yaija, yaahurira nibabuuzana; ku yaamanyire ngu yaabagarukamu gye, nawe yaamubuuza ati: Ekiragiro ekirikukira ebindi obukuru ni kiiha?",
